WEBVTT

00:03:29.330 --> 00:03:33.292
and making sure that we understood
the virtues of going your own way,

00:03:33.292 --> 00:03:36.963
which is why I believe
today at the age of 94,

00:03:36.963 --> 00:03:38.381
and a recent widow,

00:03:38.381 --> 00:03:40.841
my mom is still carving out ways

00:03:40.841 --> 00:03:45.346
to find and determine and define
her own version of happiness.

00:03:46.597 --> 00:03:48.099
She cooks for herself.

00:03:48.641 --> 00:03:51.227
She maintains her home
exactly as she sees fit.

00:03:52.103 --> 00:03:55.356
She enjoys champagne and R-rated films.

00:03:55.523 --> 00:03:56.524
(Laughter)

00:03:56.732 --> 00:03:57.733
(Applause)

00:03:59.151 --> 00:04:02.071
My mom has managed
to maintain her glamour,